# Dev-only preview config. Points at directories on one machine (../test-project,
# ../roaster, scratch copies) that do not exist for anyone else, so shipping it just
# gives every cloner a broken server entry. Phase 3.5 writes a fresh one per project.
.claude/launch.json

# Internal testing handoff. Excluded by default because it names two private projects
# that were used read-only as scan corpora, and describes specific bugs found in them.
# It is a working log for whoever maintains this plugin, not user documentation, so it
# loses nothing by staying local. To publish it, delete this line and first replace the
# project names with generic descriptions ("a private Tailwind v4 Next.js app").
TESTING.md

# Eval run output. Each `claude plugin eval` run writes a timestamped directory with
# aggregate-result.json and report.html. The cases themselves are source and do ship.
evals/results/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Scratch output from running the scanners locally
*.tokens.txt
drift-out.txt
